     Travar\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-[220px_minmax(150px,1fr)_150px_78px] items-center gap-4 border-b border-[#2a3135] py-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-1\">\n                            <span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#f79138]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-1-1\">\n                            </span>\n                            <div class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#edf0f2]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-1-2\">\n                                Layout 2\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"relative h-1 rounded-full bg-[#343b40]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-2\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 h-1 w-[9%] rounded-full bg-[#f79138]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-2-1\">\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"absolute left-[9%] top-1/2 h-3 w-3 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full border-2 border-[#171c1f] bg-[#f79138]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-2-2\">\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"text-right text-[13px] font-semibold tabular-nums text-[#f0c49e]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-3\">\n                            1:100.000\n                        </div>\n                        <button aria-label=\"Travar centro do Layout 2\" class=\"flex h-8 items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded border border-[#424b50] text-[11px] text-[#d2d8db]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-4\">\n                            <i class=\"ph ph-lock-open text-[14px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-2-4-1\">\n                            </i>\n                            Travar\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-[220px_minmax(150px,1fr)_150px_78px] items-center g